00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:19.634
-I want to talk about the show
"The Hype."

00:02:19.634 --> 00:02:21.300
-Yes, sir.
-Because this is --

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.534
It's almost like
a "Project Runway" type of show

00:02:23.534 --> 00:02:25.300
but it's about streetwear.
-Yes.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.234
-And you're one of the judges.
It's a great idea.

00:02:27.234 --> 00:02:28.767
You're also one of
the producers.

00:02:28.767 --> 00:02:30.434
-Yes, sir.
-What made you decide

00:02:30.434 --> 00:02:32.734
to do a show about streetwear?

00:02:32.734 --> 00:02:36.334
-Because streetwear, like,
it leads the culture in fashion.

00:02:36.334 --> 00:02:37.734
Like, even with
the big designer brands,

00:02:37.734 --> 00:02:40.033
and a lot of those names
get their designs stolen.

00:02:40.033 --> 00:02:42.634
And they don't have the platform
to show that they created this.

00:02:42.634 --> 00:02:44.934
And it's like they're getting
buried while the bigger brands

00:02:44.934 --> 00:02:46.701
is like taking the source
and running with it.

00:02:46.701 --> 00:02:48.968
So I just wanted
to put a show together

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:51.234
where we put the light on them
and let them shine,

00:02:51.234 --> 00:02:52.901
because the art
is coming from them,

00:02:52.901 --> 00:02:54.567
and it's getting took
from other brands.

00:02:54.567 --> 00:02:56.100
And they're getting
taken advantage of.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:58.501
They don't have the platform.
So with "The Hype,"

00:02:58.501 --> 00:03:01.934
you get the -- if you win,
you win $150,000,

00:03:01.934 --> 00:03:03.300
and then,
throughout the challenges,

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.934
you get to be on StockX
and, like, different platforms

00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:07.968
with streetwear.
It's the biggest for streetwear.

00:03:07.968 --> 00:03:09.801
-StockX, yeah, it's a big deal.

00:03:09.801 --> 00:03:12.734
But is it tough to be a judge
with these designers?

00:03:12.734 --> 00:03:15.667
'Cause you're like --
You can't really say "No,"

00:03:15.667 --> 00:03:16.834
