-I mean --

00:03:16.834 --> 00:03:19.734
Well, with my show,
I kept it 100 on that.

00:03:19.734 --> 00:03:23.634
So, like, I wasn't
saying yes to everything.

00:03:23.634 --> 00:03:25.167
If I didn't like it,
I didn't like it.

00:03:25.167 --> 00:03:27.267
Like, one time, it was a
challenge, and I didn't like it,

00:03:27.267 --> 00:03:29.567
so we had to create a whole
new challenge and start over.

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:31.000
Even on the other side
of production,

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.434
like writing it together,
because I can't stamp nothing

00:03:33.434 --> 00:03:36.033
that I'm not gonna represent.
I'm not gonna be fake.

00:03:36.033 --> 00:03:38.467
And then, in the world of
fashion, it's rough, it's hard.

00:03:38.467 --> 00:03:39.734
It's like,
it's a lot of judgment.

00:03:39.734 --> 00:03:40.801
You got to come
with something unique

00:03:40.801 --> 00:03:42.300
that somebody else
ain't already did.

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:45.067
And it's not nice,
so I'm just training them

00:03:45.067 --> 00:03:46.701
to get to the next level.
-That's good.

